      "text": "Dance science applies exercise physiology, biomechanics, anatomy, nutrition, and psychology to the athletic demands of performance. Dancers are athletes with aesthetic constraints -- they must train like distance runners while performing like gymnasts, and they must do it in ways that look effortless."
    },
