      "text": "```\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|              DANCE SCIENCE: THE PERFORMANCE SYSTEM                |\n|                                                                   |\n|  PHYSIOLOGICAL          BIOMECHANICAL         PSYCHOLOGICAL       |\n|  DEMANDS                DEMANDS               DEMANDS             |\n|                                                                   |\n|  VO2max: 50-65          Extreme ROM           Performance anxiety |\n|  Aerobic base           (hip ext. rotation)   Body image          |\n|  Anaerobic bursts       Impact force mgmt     Eating disorders    |\n|  Muscle endurance       Balance precision     Perfectionism       |\n|  Flexibility            Postural control      Injury psychology   |\n|                                                                   |\n|  TRAINING               INJURY                RECOVERY            |\n|  6 hrs/day              Stress fractures      Periodization       |\n|  Barre + center         Hip impingement       Active recovery     |\n|  Rehearsal              Overuse syndromes     Cross-training      |\n|  10-15 yr minimum       Eating disorder       Nutrition mgmt      |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
