      "text": "AEROBIC SYSTEM (oxidative phosphorylation):\n  Sustains: continuous moderate-intensity movement (adagio, corps work)\n  Duration: unlimited with adequate fuel\n  Fuel: glycogen + fat\n  Limitation: oxygen delivery rate"
    },
