      "text": "BALLET PERFORMANCE CONTEXT:\n    A 2-hour performance (e.g., Swan Lake with intermission)\n    Effective work time: ~50-70 minutes continuous\n    VO2max required: 50-65 mL/kg/min\n    Comparable to: middle-distance running\n    Heart rate during performance: 150-180 bpm sustained"
    },
