      "text": "ANAEROBIC ALACTIC SYSTEM (phosphocreatine, PCr):\n  Sustains: maximal jumps, explosive starts\n  Duration: 8-12 seconds maximum\n  Fuel: stored ATP + phosphocreatine in muscle\n  Limitation: PCr store depletion"
    },
